{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1000_038chz", "source_sha256": "5973190ee3030366c51ce27fe41e6a1a88f7aeea0fc2840b21048ab638aef14f", "ja": "さすがに、我慢の限界でしてよ！", "zh": "真是忍耐到极限了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1001_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1002_048rei", "source_sha256": "060ed36ca6dd517c7f0a82f3c909692cb734a597aee395f135ac1cda2aadc1bb", "ja": "あ！　やっぱり千鶴ちゃんだったんだ？", "zh": "啊！果然是千鹤呀？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1003_003mik", "source_sha256": "e63a0c0117a2beaad8888806f5d41101fe1545556514d36c3afbea5881ad493e", "ja": "外からも、すっごくガミガミ～って声が聞こえたの。", "zh": "在外面都能听到好大声的唠唠叨叨呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1004_030iku", "source_sha256": "b495b277e24c22b81d14704a15c7796f2e6e83b8d041506b5322a7814e5f3295", "ja": "もしかして、今度の千鶴さんの公演のことで\n{$P$}さんとケンカしてたの？", "zh": "难道说，是因为千鹤小姐下次公演的事，\n和{$P$}先生吵架了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1005_022ser", "source_sha256": "522adada7ca2bbbb92e2ad05e1d3ea3ac79c90cf11d6dc61ff31abe259ca3943", "ja": "でも、今は千鶴さんひとりみたいです。\nあの、どうしたんですか？", "zh": "不过，现在好像只有千鹤小姐一个人。\n那个，请问发生什么事了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "adf953292fe7e3a34b496084d49f25db58d027924b67844c431e8e9de2b11e81", "ja": "どうしたもこうしたもありませんわ！\nみなさん、聞いてくださいまし！", "zh": "哪有什么“怎么了”不“怎么了”的！\n请大家听我说！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "0e6d808ade6f17ef79a53c4760409eeee33b428167f1c2fe53ee312672778f92", "ja": "数日前のことなのですけれど……。", "zh": "那是几天前的事了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1008_se", "source_sha256": "16a3caf2a565487c65bd952654e44a76881a202ad8bd3ef07983abca8beac400", "ja": "ブゥーン……キキーッ！\nバタンバタン！", "zh": "嗡——……吱——！\n砰砰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1009_038chz", "source_sha256": "d2fcde41638093ad3f8ab68964597c7ee727dde24e24400c2047424ea3889747", "ja": "……っ！\nあの方々……またですわ……。", "zh": "……！\n那几位……又来了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1010_reporter1", "source_sha256": "77a29d4c5aa09fc49f2199ef7b85caaa6c71daf9724334d94828052ddf2706a4", "ja": "どうも、765プロの二階堂千鶴さんですよね！\n少し、よろしいですか？", "zh": "您好，您就是765事务所的二阶堂千鹤小姐吧！  \n可以占用您一点时间吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1011_se", "source_sha256": "a2deb79733ea34571ffb1106defef6f98e4cf37cb6bf97632d672f605d068aad", "ja": "パシャパシャッ！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1012_reporter2", "source_sha256": "0721b0ff94b84afe500c45f7d27791b740564c3a4fcf358b6cf9441c04f35237", "ja": "ご出演されたセレブ芸能人たちの\nトーク番組、SNSでも話題になっていますね！", "zh": "您出演的名人艺人们参加的谈话节目，在社交媒体上也成为热门话题了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1013_reporter2", "source_sha256": "7fdabbd07ced974ed7e641edbd6d914444b6cadd4dfbdc2c74375ab4cebf7789", "ja": "二階堂さんのセレブエピソードも大変興味深く、\nぜひ日常の過ごし方など取材させてください！", "zh": "二阶堂小姐的名媛轶事也非常有趣，请务必让我采访一下您平时的生活方式等！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "55682a005177d2b18fb4e18df8c1cbbd1d549e5afbd7cbe1da5845551da38d80", "ja": "え、ええ……。\n申し訳ありません、急いでおりますので……。", "zh": "呃、嗯……  \n真是抱歉，我还有急事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1015_reporter1", "source_sha256": "0232f33fe67086e01344f444fb6e5433a47c95fc0ebe5f94ee802c2dd0cb0180", "ja": "まあまあ、つれないことを仰らずに！\nこの業界、持ちつ持たれつじゃないですか！", "zh": "好了好了，别说这么见外的话嘛！  \n在这个圈子里，不就是互相帮衬嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1016_reporter1", "source_sha256": "73086df58d654b132876b2782f5f6c7dae7a9c4629b19788cf8c433efb3ec38f", "ja": "セレブのプライベート、みんな知りたがってるんです！\nどのような豪邸に住まれているのかだけでも！", "zh": "大家都想知道名媛的私生活！\n至少也想知道您住在什么样的豪宅里！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1017_se", "source_sha256": "0f176f27429c0c06ad943d6a13d7fa4090bf0ab7358e14e204cf27762b5ac968", "ja": "パシャパシャパシャッ！", "zh": "咔嚓咔嚓咔嚓！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1018_038chz", "source_sha256": "086025d61c7d80336c9eb9d24955d60af7fea4ffbab17a5bf083ff20c0cefb75", "ja": "し、失礼いたしますわ～！", "zh": "失、失礼了～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1019_038chz", "source_sha256": "a789c49f61646db8c07711cdd3f167b0a1efd444397017ca08c17f077a5b1cc8", "ja": "と、いうことがあって……。それからというもの、\n毎日どこへ行くにも追いかけられていますの！", "zh": "事情是这样的……从那以后，\n不管每天去哪儿都会被跟踪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1020_030iku", "source_sha256": "8a1becb700112d77cd08ee0aa509501fee24ce680079cbf8e12869dfe1166f69", "ja": "そうだったんだ……。記者さんだからって、おうちまで\nついて来るのは、プライバシーのしんがいだよね！", "zh": "原来是这样啊……就算是记者，也不能跟到家里来吧，\n这可是侵犯隐私呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1021_003mik", "source_sha256": "1f0ea5b5c28e9ff7dcff738e8920b75e969933ed1921ca924b32c2b8eaed5919", "ja": "でも、それだけ人気が出てきたってことかも☆", "zh": "不过，这也说明我越来越受欢迎了☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "67784cf7082ae6a837aeb1a588d504a41e01665b49d542a46a863bfa2d7f8c32", "ja": "そ、それは……。\nまあ、セレブみたいで、悪い気はしませんけれど……。", "zh": "那、那个……。  \n不过，感觉像名流一样，倒也不坏……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1023_048rei", "source_sha256": "16c1fffeb1cc8df38c68f057b4301301bcfb15d1e88cd1c3516b8a3ca21cb485", "ja": "？　みたい？", "zh": "？像什么？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1024_038chz", "source_sha256": "1d873120ce26afa99b8190646640033777ec3589504fd60084622940db48b5e2", "ja": "ゲフン、なんでもありませんわ！\nとにかく、今日もここに来るまで大変でしたのよ？", "zh": "咳咳，没什么！  \n总之，今天来这里之前也是费了不少周折呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1025_003mik", "source_sha256": "4d8d27724de8eb8d43c28665f9a71dc40c48d9920b170200fe262fc1f830823d", "ja": "パパラッチ、しつこいもんね。\nミキは、あんまり気にしてないけど。", "zh": "狗仔队真是没完没了呢。\n不过美希倒是不怎么在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1026_022ser", "source_sha256": "5728a839945de5b64807c95d25f2d003d550a13862fcea9c229a84e6ca193f9f", "ja": "そういえば……わたしの家の前にも、\n記者さんがいたことがあります！", "zh": "说起来……我家门口也有过记者！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1027_030iku", "source_sha256": "19d56ce101973cf3d4cf86f3076daf7daa0d345b64ab36d4240cbc49a150b250", "ja": "星梨花ちゃんも？\nその時は、どうしたの？", "zh": "星梨花也遇到过吗？\n那时候，你是怎么做的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1028_022ser", "source_sha256": "916143045aece0eaa5fbdd35d0354154abc6f7df4aa0e75c8607f779176c9f15", "ja": "それが、お仕事大変ですねって声をかけたら、\nいなくなっちゃったの。", "zh": "我跟她说了句“工作真辛苦呢”，结果她就不见了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1029_048rei", "source_sha256": "c277a909cff08261af4bead963300c56ca862df582359025b2b967333b17a2c1", "ja": "なるほどなるほど～。\n良心に訴えかける作戦だね！", "zh": "原来如此原来如此～。\n这是诉诸良心的作战呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1030_003mik", "source_sha256": "f3547e69e7dd3e5a2918fac5dcdb4a66aa2b09a878e0b15b9dabedc7b6583452", "ja": "でも、それって星梨花とか育みたいな\n小さい子しか使えないかも？", "zh": "不过，那种办法可能只有像星梨花和育这样的\n小孩子才能用吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1031_038chz", "source_sha256": "4ffe97139b2d2a86da10d5575a88493f66151ab42a66a63f18343b856d317897", "ja": "そうですわね……。そういうわけで、\n今は仕事に行くにも大変なんですの。", "zh": "是这样呢……所以现在就连去工作都很困难。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "9ad210ae0ceda3e212acec9d1afd4b1eaf6c2307e7ea9fb71b2477838e99a50b", "ja": "幸い、自宅はまだですけれど、\n大まかな場所は分かってしまったみたいで……。", "zh": "万幸的是，家里虽然还没暴露，\n但大致位置似乎已经被知道了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1033_030iku", "source_sha256": "6445168ae0e17121912fdea5002d630c96a733dcd8f15d80ae2c1be3c0e8321d", "ja": "えっ、そうなんだ……？", "zh": "诶，是这样啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1034_038chz", "source_sha256": "280cec50a6b5aa5744e789042e975699d329559463e27df21fd4a85718a79f30", "ja": "ええ。ご近所に聞き込みをして回っているそうですわ。", "zh": "是的。听说他们正在挨家挨户地打听呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1035_038chz", "source_sha256": "7ac58ef0dce4e36ce470fd1c0af770d2f3f9f5dc3f6bfea2ff1689fa70067af7", "ja": "もちろん皆様わたくしをかばって、知らないフリを\nしてくださっているのですけど……。", "zh": "虽然大家都在护着我，\n假装什么都不知道就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1036_003mik", "source_sha256": "969b4357338b3fa008a6d938565aaebc0ecc278c28eadd6f43b8cd9a9505ceaf", "ja": "うーん。でも、いつバレちゃっても\nおかしくないよね。", "zh": "嗯——不过，随时被发现也不奇怪吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1037_038chz", "source_sha256": "b2d3934c78394886d3d3836b7505405d69b9dde2609378f505484b3d71d0e549", "ja": "そうなんですの……。\nはぁ。困りましたわ……。", "zh": "就是这样……  \n唉，真是伤脑筋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1038_048rei", "source_sha256": "9f040a3bd5818c43a1166f33ce86784cce744c7106a5ecd33238be2212942a67", "ja": "そのこと、{$P$}さんは\n知ってるの？", "zh": "那件事，{$P$}先生知道吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1039_038chz", "source_sha256": "96add88660a7f20532b8ee22ed5fafdc432b0a0f2e5ea190fdee58e71d75e747", "ja": "もちろんですわ。それで……、パパラッチが諦めるまで\nしばらくホテルに泊まることになって。", "zh": "那是当然的了。所以……在狗仔队死心之前，\n决定暂时先住在酒店里。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1040_038chz", "source_sha256": "0aff309eff846e77b30ee34ff0992bba5ea2fda0e50b1e756e29143aae6fba61", "ja": "送り迎えは、{$P$}がしてくれる\nことになりましたの。……不本意ですけれどっ！", "zh": "接送由{$P$}负责。……虽然这并非我的本意就是了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1041_048rei", "source_sha256": "d16a1d7b313b45b6f9216b01f572424b987acc8b435d667c5413ce88f2215b54", "ja": "ふーん……？", "zh": "是喔……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1042_003mik", "source_sha256": "d5da2405c8572c1217758b1f5d36fad1a41d350dc726867d10bef5ac6a419ce6", "ja": "あ、じゃあ、今はホテル暮らしってこと？\nいいないいないいな～☆", "zh": "啊，那就是说，现在住在酒店里？\n真好真好真好～☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_intro_144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_intro_144_1043_022ser", "source_sha256": "b0c58098c60f6efe6d6c4c047cf6b9ead6a2feb4064057c165eb1cebf5ff4f2c", "ja": "でも、おうちに帰れないのは不便ですよね。", "zh": "不过，没法回家还是很不方便的吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
